      "sourceHash": "49b1da1dbbf14d8a5e98f633a43d559cd5be49df92521b099383731cd321b9da",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "So how can we build our Angular application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 6.75,
          "en": "as a server side rendered app?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.75,
          "end": 10.59,
          "en": "Well, thankfully Angular helps us here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.59,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "Turning an Angular application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 16.92,
          "en": "into a server side rendered Angular application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.92,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "or an Angular application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.87,
          "end": 21.75,
          "en": "that's ready for server side rendering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.75,
          "end": 26.75,
          "en": "is as simple as running NG add @Angular/ssr.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.01,
          "end": 32.4,
          "en": "Now, I did already mention this ng add command before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 37.17,
          "en": "And as mentioned there, you can use this command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.17,
          "end": 39.57,
          "en": "to add libraries to your project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "and to also configure your project for these libraries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 47.52,
          "en": "So only libraries only collections",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "that support this command can be added with it in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "And server side rendering is a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 58.68,
          "en": "that's provided by Angular itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.68,
          "end": 61.238,
          "en": "and it is a feature that can in the end be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.238,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "by adding this special Angular SSR library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 67.533,
          "en": "with that NG add command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.4,
          "end": 73.02,
          "en": "Alternatively, when creating a new Angular project with NGU,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.02,
          "end": 77.4,
          "en": "you could also add this //SSR flag to the command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.4,
          "end": 79.92,
          "en": "to create an Angular project that comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.92,
          "end": 83.043,
          "en": "with server side rendering and enabled right from the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 88.02,
          "en": "With that, if you hit Enter, Angular will go ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.02,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "and then possibly ask you a couple of questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "and then go through a couple of steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "to prepare this project for server side rendering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 101.169,
          "en": "and the Angular CLI will actually also give you an overview",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.169,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "of the core steps it took to prepare this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 107.793,
          "en": "for server side rendering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.63,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "For example, it updated the TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "and the Angular configuration files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 117.63,
          "en": "And the Angular configuration file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.63,
          "end": 120.09,
          "en": "is the more interesting one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.09,
          "end": 122.43,
          "en": "In there it added various settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.43,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "to support server side rendering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 126.75,
          "en": "You could have done that manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.75,
          "end": 129.447,
          "en": "but that would've been more work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.447,
          "end": 131.423,
          "en": "So that's a pretty useful command to run.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.27,
          "end": 136.86,
          "en": "It for example, also added this server.TS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.86,
          "end": 141.75,
          "en": "which in the end contains the code of this node JS server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.75,
          "end": 145.653,
          "en": "that will in the end be used to serve your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.49,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "So it's this compiled file combined with some other code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 155.313,
          "en": "that must be deployed to that dynamic web hosting provider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.91,
          "en": "Now, you could tweak the code in this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.91,
          "end": 163.26,
          "en": "if you needed to to support other routes or other settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 163.26,
          "end": 168.26,
          "en": "but by default, this server is set up such that it's ready",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "to dynamically run your Angular code on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.86,
          "end": 176.73,
          "en": "and that it's then also able to return the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.73,
          "end": 180.72,
          "en": "of running your Angular code as a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.72,
          "end": 183.21,
          "en": "to the website visitor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.21,
          "end": 185.897,
          "en": "So this server code here takes care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.897,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "of preparing your Angular driven pages on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 194.7,
          "en": "and of serving them back to the website users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 194.7,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "Now in addition, there also have been some adjustments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 199.68,
          "en": "to the source folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.68,
          "end": 203.76,
          "en": "For example, a main.server ts file was added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.76,
          "end": 208.11,
          "en": "This is needed to do the application initialization",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 209.25,
          "en": "on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.25,
          "end": 211.72,
          "en": "If the Angular code executes there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 213,
          "end": 218,
          "en": "and an app.config.server.ts file was added as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.31,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "and that simply configures the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 222.483,
          "en": "for server side rendering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.59,
          "end": 226.29,
          "en": "Now none of your code was deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.29,
          "end": 227.727,
          "en": "Instead it was just adjusted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.727,
          "end": 231.57,
          "en": "to now also support server side rendering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 231.57,
          "end": 234.03,
          "en": "But you could now still work on that project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 234.03,
          "end": 236.46,
          "en": "as you did before, and add components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 236.46,
          "end": 240.363,
          "en": "and use all these Angular features as you did it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 241.86,
          "end": 244.11,
          "en": "But with that, the app is now prepared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 244.11,
          "end": 245.67,
          "en": "for server side rendering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.67,
          "end": 248.67,
          "en": "and therefore we can now try building it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.67,
          "end": 250.803,
          "en": "as a server side rendered app.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
